  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Media Support (IMS) Georgia - International Media Support (IMS) Georgia - New Strategy 2026-2030</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">International Media Support (IMS) Georgia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall objective is media partners have increased capacity to produce and distribute data-driven reliable content.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bidraget bygger p&#xe5; och existerar i n&#xe4;ra synergi med REACH-projektet som st&#xf6;ds av danska UD. Det syftar till att l&#xe4;gga till nya komponenter i syfte att st&#xe4;rka mediepartnerna och &#xf6;ka r&#xe4;ckvidden samt kvaliteten p&#xe5; det inneh&#xe5;ll som produceras inom pilotgruppen i Georgien</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution builds on and exists in close synergy with the REACH project supported by Danish MFA. It seeks to add new components with the aim to strengthen the media partners and increase the outreach as well as the quality of the content produced within the Pilot Group in Georgia.</narrative>
  </description>
